===Verb===
{{hu-verb}}

# {{lb|hu|transitive}} to [[spin]] {{gloss|to make thread by twisting fibers}}
#: ''Gyapjút '''fontak'''.'' - They were spinning wool.
# {{lb|hu|transitive}} to [[weave]]
#: ''kosarat '''fon''''' - to weave baskets
# {{lb|hu|transitive}} to [[weave]] something (into something {{hu-case|ba}})
#: ''Gyöngyöket '''font''' a hajá'''ba'''.'' - She wove pearls in her hair.
# {{lb|hu|transitive}} to [[braid]], [[plait]] {{gloss|to interweave three or more strands, strips}}
#: ''A haját copfba '''fonta'''.'' - She plaited her hair.

